<section class="page-hero shell archive-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-copy" data-reveal>
    <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> ARCHIVE / BY TIME</p>
    <h1>文章归档</h1>
    <p>所有公开文字，按时间从新到旧排列。共 <%= stats.posts %> 篇，约 <%= Math.max(1, Math.round(stats.words / 1000)) %>k 字。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="archive-word" data-reveal aria-hidden="true">ARCHIVE</div>
</section>

<section class="shell archive-layout">
  <% if (groups.length) { %>
  <div class="archive-timeline">
    <% groups.forEach((group, groupIndex) => { %>
    <section class="archive-year" data-reveal>
      <header>
        <h2><%= group.year %></h2>
        <span><%= group.months.reduce((sum, month) => sum + month.posts.length, 0) %> 篇 / <%= String(groupIndex + 1).padStart(2, '0') %></span>
      </header>
      <div class="archive-months">
        <% group.months.forEach(month => { %>
        <div class="archive-month">
          <h3><%= month.label %></h3>
          <div class="month-posts">
            <% month.posts.forEach(post => { %>
            <a class="month-post" href="/posts/<%= post.slug %>" style="--accent: <%= post.category_color || '#0a8a4e' %>">
              <span class="month-post-date"><%= post.published_at ? post.published_at.slice(8, 10) : '' %></span>
              <span class="month-post-main">
                <strong><%= post.title %></strong>
                <small><%= post.category_name || '未分类' %> · <%= post.reading_time %> 分钟</small>
              </span>
              <svg><use href="/assets/images/icons.svg#icon-arrow"></use></svg>
            </a>
            <% }) %>
          </div>
        </div>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
    </section>
    <% }) %>
  </div>
  <% } else { %>
  <div class="empty-state"><h2>还没有可以归档的文章。</h2><a class="button button-primary" href="/posts">浏览文章</a></div>
  <% } %>

  <aside class="archive-aside" data-reveal>
    <div class="aside-numbers">
      <div><strong><%= stats.posts %></strong><span>篇文章</span></div>
      <div><strong><%= stats.words %></strong><span>总字数</span></div>
      <div><strong><%= stats.comments %></strong><span>条回应</span></div>
    </div>
    <p>时间会让文章重新排列。归档不是仓库，而是一条可以回望的路径。</p>
    <a class="button button-quiet" href="/feed.xml">通过 RSS 订阅 <svg><use href="/assets/images/icons.svg#icon-rss"></use></svg></a>
  </aside>
</section>
